The trajectory fetcher and visible history projection in pd_kv_transfer_opt/workloads,
the model in pd_kv_transfer_opt/simulator/trace_replay.py, and its CPU tests were
adapted from the PegaFlow experiment workspace. The inherited Apache-2.0 license
is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

The proxy wrapper loads the separately installed vLLM-Ascend example at runtime.
Its source and the Mooncake runtime are referenced by version in the deployment
notes. Dataset files, model weights, and profiling runtimes are upstream assets.
